cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite this repository as below. The papers of the methods it implements
  are cited at the end of each model's README.
title: "reimp: reimplementations of RNA-seq representation learners on TCGA"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Altay
    given-names: Gabriel
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/galtay/reimp"
abstract: >-
  Reimplementations of RNA-seq representation learners on one shared
  footing: TCGA bulk RNA-seq, the same patient-level 5-fold
  cross-validation, and the same linear probes for every model.
keywords:
  - RNA-seq
  - representation learning
  - TCGA
  - foundation models
  - benchmarking
